{"schemaVersion":3,"value":{"rows":[{"id":"e0c097c0-cda8-4177-931a-b93eab0c795e","name":"Engineering","description":"Owns Michael Hurley's engineering surface: GitHub repos, issues, pull requests, Actions, and Vercel deploys. Investigates, ships, and reports status. Does not merge, force-push, or production-deploy without a clear ask. Escalates product and architecture calls to Chief of Staff. Direct and technical, brief unless the work needs detail.","title":"","avatarShape":null,"avatarColor":null,"avatarVersion":null,"createdAt":1788381772843,"updatedAt":1788446925067,"path":"/home/box/sand-data/agents/e0c097c0-cda8-4177-931a-b93eab0c795e/store.db","lastEntry":{"kind":"text","text":"Treat these as issue tickets for the omadesign project and resolve them all:\n\n\n\n1. pen tool has a regression you have to drag to set a point.\n\n2. pen tool + node tool behaviors need full feature and behavior parity with affinity, adobe illustrator, inkscape.\n\n3. once a raster object is placed on an artboard it can not be moved, selected, manipulated in anyway.\n\n4. SVG export is shotty see omadesign/media/logo.svg compared to logo.oma\n\n5. i cannot select an object copy with ctrl+c, so i can't tell if ctrl+v pastes an object, also alt + drag doesn't clone an object.\n\n6. i should be able to import, place and/or open any vector or raster format (svg, png, eps, jpeg, etc.) and/or including proprietary: (.afdesign, .ai, .pdf, .psd, etc.) files.\n\n7. if i have unsaved work i need a discard, cancel, save dialog.\n\n8. while working if i go idle for more than 1s save a temporary file in ~/.local/share/omadesign/<UUID>.oma.swp like neovim does so i can recover files in the event of a crash, saving action should delete this *.oma.swp file from this directory.\n\n9. opening splash should have a recents tab that shows me my .omas i've edited.\n\n10. if there are any files matching ~/.local/share/omadesign/<UUID>.oma.swp i should see a recovered tab.\n\n11. layer sidebar should expand to show objects on the layer\n\n12. objects should be able to have their own fx not just layer-wide.\n\n13. I should be able to rotate and resize artboards.\n\n14. An artboard tool should allow me to clone artboards and draw new ones and choose off artboard objects and wrap their bounding box in an artboard.\n\n15. I should be able to name artboards.\n\n16. Like illustrator and affinity i should have corner rounding handles in both select mode (for all corners) and node mode (for selected nodes)\n\n17. I should be able to shift+click to grab multiple nodes in node select mode and grab + drag to move lines and draw a box around a collection of nodes to select only those nodes for dragging around the canvas.\n\n18. Font dialog should start at the currently selected font instead of at the top, have a search box, have a recents area pinned at the top and have a used area pinned at the top (used area shows fonts in this document) recents shows last 5 font's used regardless of when, which document, etc.\n\n19. document tabs? if i ctrl+n 5 times i should end up with 5 tabs, if i ctrl+o pick a document and repeat that 5 times i should see 5 tabs. tabs should be a sidebar to the left of the tool picker panel."},"lastMessageId":"t0s0","newestEntryId":"t1u","hasUnread":false,"unreadCount":0,"lastViewedAt":1788446925067,"lastActivityAt":1788446925067,"awaitingUserResponse":null,"notificationsEnabled":false,"notifyOnUpdatesEnabled":true,"isHiddenFromSidebar":false,"origin":"user","isGroup":false,"memberIds":[]},{"id":"b85a7a3c-6c23-4d10-9b4d-478a11f069a9","name":"Chief of Staff","description":"Manages your other Bots and pulls you in for decisions The user works with Google, Notion, LinkedIn, Zoom, GitHub, Figma, Canva, Stripe, Vercel every day — start with those tools when suggesting connectors or taking on work.","title":"","avatarShape":"hex","avatarColor":"orange","avatarVersion":null,"createdAt":1788381622633,"updatedAt":1788391048085,"path":"/home/box/sand-data/agents/b85a7a3c-6c23-4d10-9b4d-478a11f069a9/store.db","lastEntry":{"kind":"text","text":"Connect Stripe","sessionPreview":{"kind":"connector_connect","connector":"Stripe"}},"lastMessageId":"t1s2","newestEntryId":"t1s2","hasUnread":false,"unreadCount":0,"lastViewedAt":1788446775528,"lastActivityAt":1788391048085,"awaitingUserResponse":null,"notificationsEnabled":false,"notifyOnUpdatesEnabled":true,"isHiddenFromSidebar":false,"origin":"user","isGroup":false,"memberIds":[]},{"id":"b167c1ca-6eef-44d1-acd7-eca68f4f1897","name":"Revenue","description":"Owns Michael Hurley's money systems: Stripe payments, customers, invoices, subscriptions, and payouts. Read first, mutate only with a clear ask. Never refund, change prices, or issue credits without confirmation. Escalates pricing, exceptions, and anything irreversible to Chief of Staff. Precise with numbers; never invent metrics.","title":"","avatarShape":null,"avatarColor":null,"avatarVersion":null,"createdAt":1788381773696,"updatedAt":1788381773696,"path":"/home/box/sand-data/agents/b167c1ca-6eef-44d1-acd7-eca68f4f1897/store.db","lastEntry":null,"lastMessageId":null,"newestEntryId":null,"hasUnread":false,"unreadCount":0,"lastViewedAt":0,"lastActivityAt":0,"awaitingUserResponse":null,"notificationsEnabled":false,"notifyOnUpdatesEnabled":true,"isHiddenFromSidebar":false,"origin":"user","isGroup":false,"memberIds":[]},{"id":"54a99c4b-ee31-4916-a392-4f1bb29b1bc7","name":"Design","description":"Owns Michael Hurley's design work: Canva for decks, social, and brand assets; Figma via the browser since it has no connector. Matches existing brand. Does not invent a new visual system unless asked. Escalates creative direction to Chief of Staff. Visual-first: show the work, keep words short.","title":"","avatarShape":null,"avatarColor":null,"avatarVersion":null,"createdAt":1788381773307,"updatedAt":1788381773307,"path":"/home/box/sand-data/agents/54a99c4b-ee31-4916-a392-4f1bb29b1bc7/store.db","lastEntry":null,"lastMessageId":null,"newestEntryId":null,"hasUnread":false,"unreadCount":0,"lastViewedAt":0,"lastActivityAt":0,"awaitingUserResponse":null,"notificationsEnabled":false,"notifyOnUpdatesEnabled":true,"isHiddenFromSidebar":false,"origin":"user","isGroup":false,"memberIds":[]},{"id":"a1ef1c03-b1bf-4abb-b179-721859006728","name":"Ops","description":"Owns Michael Hurley's day-to-day operations: Gmail inbox triage, Google Calendar and Zoom scheduling, Google Drive files, and Notion as the source of truth. Drafts and sends as Michael, never as a bot. Keeps meetings, follow-ups, and docs current. Flags decisions that need Michael to Chief of Staff instead of guessing. Concise, practical, no fluff.","title":"","avatarShape":null,"avatarColor":null,"avatarVersion":null,"createdAt":1788381772427,"updatedAt":1788381772427,"path":"/home/box/sand-data/agents/a1ef1c03-b1bf-4abb-b179-721859006728/store.db","lastEntry":null,"lastMessageId":null,"newestEntryId":null,"hasUnread":false,"unreadCount":0,"lastViewedAt":0,"lastActivityAt":0,"awaitingUserResponse":null,"notificationsEnabled":false,"notifyOnUpdatesEnabled":true,"isHiddenFromSidebar":false,"origin":"user","isGroup":false,"memberIds":[]}]}}